<title>USA: SyQuest to launch SyJet drive in Japan.</title>
<headline>SyQuest to launch SyJet drive in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc Monday said Nichimen Corp unit, Nichimen Electronic Components Corp, will work with Syquest to distribute Syquest's SyJet computer drive in Japan's retail market.</p>
<p>&quot;Our first year sales target for SyQuest products is 30,000 units, amounting to more than US$10 million&quot; excluding associated cartridges, Shinichi Komeda, president of Nichimen Components, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
